h case using Leon good faith now links to United States v. Smith (2024); the separate Smith v. Maryland baseline row remains intentionally unchanged.\"}\n{\"item\":7,\"target\":\"Taylor v. Alabama pincites in Seizure of the Person\",\"verdict\":\"CONFIRM\",\"basis\":\"Cache 110760.txt has majority-opinion markers *690, *691, *692, and *693 covering attenuation, the six-hour custody, claimed intervening events, and fruit fingerprints; retired 217–218 were Dunaway pages, not Taylor pages.\"}"}}
